=2 Walkthrough
* Enter {z:Altar Room} for a cutscene that starts this quest.
** Head past the left/right switch gate with the trap door, then head to (G-7) to enter a different map. Turn right and head straight to re-enter the castle. Finally, head to (G-10).
** If you choose not to accept this quest, you will not be given the chance to start it again until the next Conquest Tally.
* Speak to {p:Ponono}, {z:Windurst Woods} (G-12) for a cutscene.
* Trade {p:Ponono} a {i:Velvet Cloth|Velvet Cloth|828}, {i:Rainbow Cloth|Rainbow Cloth|830}, and 10,000 gil.
* Wait until the next game day to talk to {p:Ponono} again who will give you {i:Yagudo Cutting|Yagudo Cutting|1867} and instructions on how to craft it into a {i:Yagudo Headgear|Yagudo Headgear|15202}.
** Zoning is no longer required.
* Synthesize a {i:Yagudo Headgear|Yagudo Headgear|15202}:

